    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδράσκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: pf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέδρᾱκα τοῦ καπηλείου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>Hist.</u>
					p.255
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>: aor. imper. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράντων</span> prob. l. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Defix.Aud.</u>
				26
			</span></i> (Crete, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράσαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1423.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>; but mostly found in compds., esp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-.</span></div>
